# Expected authz decision per identity for cel-id-roles.
# Predicate: the JWT `roles` claim contains "admin".
# Identity case: the key names a token (see cel-id-roles.tokens), NOT an HTTP
# method. All requests are GET /toys with the minted token as Bearer.
# Format: <token-key> <allow|deny>. allow -> 200, deny -> 403.
admin allow
guest deny
